{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-dirac-operator","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:categorical-dirac-operator","kind":"definition","title":"Categorical Dirac operator","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-connection","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter"],"tags":["dirac","connection","q-deformed"],"defines":["categorical-dirac-operator"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator","text":"categorical-dirac-operator.md","leanSource":"categorical-dirac-operator.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:categorical-dirac-operator\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe equipped with connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>, substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>, and Reeb derivation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code>. The <dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-categorical-dirac-operator\">categorical Dirac operator</dfn> is the morphism</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{D}_\\nabla\n  = \n  q^{-1}\\nabla +  (1 - q^{-1})\\iota_\\xi\\nabla\n   \\colon  A \\to \\Omega^1(A).</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.md","heading":"Definition","number":"4.12.1","page":"b/def-categorical-dirac-operator","qa":{"counts":{"pass":82,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":9,"unknown":0,"stale":67},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalDiracOperator","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
